---
/** Hotspot: a picture with two numbered pins on it, and the note the first one has opened. */
---

<span class="cover-media" style="display:block; width:204px; height:120px">
  <span class="cover-pin" style="top:34%; left:30%">1</span>
  <span class="cover-pin" style="top:66%; left:76%">2</span>
  <span class="cover-float cover-stack" style="position:absolute; top:58px; left:28px; --r:var(--radius-control-lg); width:108px; padding:10px 12px; --gap:7px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:48px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:80px"></i></span>
</span>
